Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.36,0:02:53.15,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:56.37,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Please get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:02:59.17,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.33,0:03:04.09,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,More like, I can't afford to sleep now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.61,0:03:05.76,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.88,0:03:08.63,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.58,0:03:11.98,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We're taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.98,0:03:12.92,Usaghi Main,guy1,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:14.04,Usaghi Main,guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:16.82,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You guys should get some rest too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:21.13,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Please call me if anything comes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.46,0:03:26.48,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight is the deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:28.37,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:00.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:04.96,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:10.51,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Feels like ice. {TIMING: Check these next couple of lines. -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.51,0:04:12.02,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're too cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:17.94,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I turn the AC off, the guys will ruin the work material with their sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:20.73,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I've heard your body temperature can drop due to stress too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:36.42,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That new job you were talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:42.21,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think it's worth dropping the quality of your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:48.73,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-chan, you're not strong in body or spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:51.59,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, you're earning enough as it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.59,0:04:53.38,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,so you don't have to be greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.38,0:04:54.51,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:55.72,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:58.07,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm earning enough for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.07,0:05:00.53,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,but I'm not so sure about next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.95,0:05:05.28,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,There are a lot of youngsters showing up in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.43,0:05:11.12,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I might be surpassed in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:15.51,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Ma-chan, you're over-thinking it in a bad way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.91,0:05:17.51,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's not good for your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:21.56,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You've got ink on your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.54,0:05:26.89,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:30.64,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're a girl, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.50,0:05:35.24,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.71,0:05:37.02,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a manga artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:41.17,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.96,0:05:47.70,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.46,0:05:51.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.35,0:05:55.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Going to work is such a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.76,0:06:02.09,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:03.92,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.29,0:06:06.14,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I called for you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:07.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:09.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:12.30,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do you feel better like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:13.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:18.74,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We should probably make lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:19.60,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:35.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, come here and help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:38.83,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.23,0:06:42.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's summer vacation has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:45.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We make her lunch in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:47.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and then she goes to a student day care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:52.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How about visiting Grandpa's grave next Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:54.76,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost time for O-bon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.11,0:06:55.89,TL Note,TL note,0000,0000,0000,,TL note: O-bon is a festival to honor your ancestors.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.76,0:06:55.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and it's also{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:58.96,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What, you don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:03.42,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers haven't bloomed yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:08.28,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They might need a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We can buy some from a florist for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:14.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and go again when the ones we're growing have bloomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:15.74,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.25,0:07:23.59,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa would be happy if we use the bellflowers you've been caring for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:26.50,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He would, wouldn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:31.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But what would make him the happiest is you being there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:34.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.00,0:07:38.14,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Right. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:51.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If Rin weren't here, I probably wouldn't be thinking about Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:55.82,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.57,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:08:01.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't do it if you keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:02.83,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:06.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, why is your hair so thin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:07.84,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.85,0:08:19.78,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.69,0:08:21.86,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Just a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.59,0:08:24.94,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, we're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's up with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.29,0:08:32.33,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, how many more days?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:36.49,Sign,SIGNS (billboard),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz355.017\pos(348,100)\fscx120\fscy126.25\frx8\fry6\bord2\3c&HE7E7E7&}Summer Evening Bon Odori Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:39.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,About 10 days, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:41.20,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.73,0:08:44.29,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,A cicada skin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.57,0:08:45.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.23,0:08:50.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:54.03,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I've got quite a few in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:57.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:08:59.68,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't shake it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:02.98,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You're going to be late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.82,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.82,0:09:09.19,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:15.63,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I've been here many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:17.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,With Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.31,0:09:18.07,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:19.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.72,0:09:22.11,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Grandma's grave is here too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.56,0:09:24.24,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa's grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:26.24,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:31.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see... My mom is Grandpa and Grandma's kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:34.16,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and I'm her son.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.93,0:09:37.47,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She's Grandpa's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.86,0:09:43.64,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But that would mean she's my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.98,0:09:47.98,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Shit! I've steered the conversation in a bad direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.89,0:09:50.01,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.97,0:09:53.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:57.07,Sign,SIGNS (center slab),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz269.335\frx4\fry358\alpha&H50&\c&HBFBEB8&\fscx188.75\fscy143.75\t(\fscx180.75\fscy130.75)\move(313,197,313,197,0,3460)}Kaga Family Grave
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.76,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That jar...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:14.22,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san had one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.48,0:10:26.82,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell? She didn't even go to the funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.33,0:10:30.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.48,0:10:33.11,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:37.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pull out the weeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.18,0:10:39.42,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:02.22,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.65,0:11:05.75,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, what's she doing, visiting his grave with another guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:17.94,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Woof!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:29.65,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.88,0:11:31.54,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:34.28,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I almost mistook you for someone dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.28,0:11:36.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm here to visit his grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:41.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not really a big deal, but I thought I should let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.03,0:11:45.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.02,0:11:48.61,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,At Grandpa's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:53.70,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:12:03.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's important to me, but I don't think of you often, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.43,0:12:06.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care about your circumstances either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.54,0:12:08.14,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Unless Rin wants to,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:11.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have no intention of letting you meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:13.85,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:19.05,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What are you trying to say, after following me out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.05,0:12:24.17,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Would you at least like to see her in secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.17,0:12:30.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to clean the grave, light some incense, and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:32.69,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It'll probably take a while, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:36.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.93,0:12:45.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do what you want! We'll just mind our work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:12:59.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:01.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:12.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.59,0:13:15.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:18.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I just had to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.95,0:13:20.61,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.61,0:13:21.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Were you waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:22.95,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:25.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Were you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.14,0:13:28.78,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:30.96,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you so flustered?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.11,0:13:33.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.61,0:13:36.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.51,0:13:37.21,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.24,0:13:39.64,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Put it on that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.64,0:13:40.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:53.68,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She's not a baby anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:58.68,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Being related to someone is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:13:59.72,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It is, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.72,0:14:01.46,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She looks just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:03.77,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That back...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:06.13,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She's pretty cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.28,0:14:09.94,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Their intimacy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:12.91,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,He's just like Souichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.81,0:14:22.96,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.50,0:14:27.38,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.76,0:14:31.13,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, O-bon is just around the corner, but this was a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.50,0:14:34.81,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That girl... She turned seven today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:36.60,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.91,0:14:39.45,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Your daughter did surprise me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:41.75,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,but I thought that guy was your ex-boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:42.90,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.76,0:14:47.35,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That man has no brains at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:14:58.83,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Although I can't tell what he'll be like after another half-century.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:02.07,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Half... century?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:05.51,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That man...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.03,0:15:08.79,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,On the surface, he seems to be her boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.75,0:15:12.14,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.85,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I won't say it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.25,0:15:16.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.61,0:15:21.05,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess there are people in this world who can find lovers quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.49,0:15:23.03,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.29,0:15:24.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.69,0:15:26.95,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we go to Grandpa's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:29.44,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty close, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:34.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That place isn't Grandpa's anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.18,0:15:36.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is there someone living there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.86,0:15:39.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, not at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:45.22,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but it belongs to my uncle... my mom's brother now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:47.74,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The family altar is there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:51.22,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.13,0:15:55.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.76,0:15:59.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If it's just going into the garden, I can ask my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:00.85,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.34,0:16:02.79,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Only the garden, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:03.32,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.98,0:16:06.15,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I know the way there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.02,0:16:16.62,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to take that job after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:18.62,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.03,0:16:21.20,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure that's okay, Ma-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.20,0:16:24.67,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I've decided to work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.59,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I need to work more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:28.71,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're working plenty hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:30.97,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,More than other people, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.95,0:16:33.28,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.27,0:16:37.94,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I need to work so hard that I don't remember what I ate the last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:39.63,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:41.86,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I forget that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.86,0:16:43.13,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.24,0:16:47.63,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't forget these memories, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.08,0:16:57.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.13,0:17:09.67,Sign,SIGNS (gate),0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(410,263)\fscx122.5\fscy105\frx6\fry10\alpha&H80&\frz356.895}Kaga
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:17.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It hasn't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:22.37,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've completely changed, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.03,0:17:42.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.41,0:17:43.50,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The bellflowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:45.62,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The soil is gone too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:50.09,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Those bellflowers were important to Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:55.05,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he didn't mean to get rid of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.34,0:18:00.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My uncle knows that they're Grandpa's favorite flower, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.90,0:18:04.05,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But they wither up during winter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.72,0:18:08.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and they're not guaranteed to blossom when spring comes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.18,0:18:12.66,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Also, these stones...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.05,0:18:15.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't spread them out like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.47,0:18:18.53,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,weeds will pop up and would be a pain to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:26.25,Usaghi Main I,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad I took Rin's fragrant olive tree from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.25,0:18:27.81,Usaghi Main I,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It escaped intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.25,0:18:32.61,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.31,0:18:36.92,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad we took Grandpa's bellflower plant home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:41.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to that, it was saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:45.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.47,0:18:52.99,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Change may not be so bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:57.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That grave will always be Grandpa's, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:58.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.43,0:19:08.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.53,0:19:15.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.71,0:19:18.63,TL Note,SIGNS (cake icing),0000,0000,0000,,On the cake: Happy birthday, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.54,0:19:18.24,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a chocolate one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.48,0:19:25.64,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Saionji-sensei, please check these one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.55,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.29,0:19:31.98,Usaghi Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,It looks pretty impossible this time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.61,0:19:36.89,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Once you say it, you really won't be able to do it, so don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:50.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.94,0:19:58.69,Usaghi Main,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish it for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.91,0:21:52.35,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! The festival stalls are going to close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.35,0:21:54.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.97,0:21:58.21,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.16,0:22:03.63,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.07,0:22:10.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Weren't we supposed to meet at the shrine?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.99,0:22:13.06,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,My mom's running late again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.06,0:22:14.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How come you're not wearing a yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.85,0:22:16.86,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I can't jump if I'm wearing one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:19.84,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Incredible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:22.44,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Where's your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.10,0:22:25.64,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,She has to put on her yukata, so she'll meet us there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.61,0:22:35.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go! The stalls are going to close!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.90,0:22:43.86,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Watch out for cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.86,0:22:44.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.97,0:22:47.69,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up! It's hard to run wearing wooden slippers!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.69,0:22:48.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll carry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.45,0:22:49.37,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.37,0:22:50.84,Usaghi Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Carry me instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.84,0:22:52.14,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
